 to delete this page and create new pages for your content. Have fun!',NULL,'Sample Page','This is an example page. It\'s different from a blog post because it will stay in one place and will show up in your site navigation (in most themes). Most peopl',1,'2026-06-09 02:03:53','2026-06-09 03:57:39',NULL,'sample-page',NULL,1,1,'Sample Page','This is an example page. It\'s different from a blog post because it will stay in one place and will show up in your site navigation (in most themes). Most peopl',NULL,'Sample Page','This is an example page. It\'s different from a blog post because it will stay in one place and will show up in your site navigation (in most themes). Most peopl',NULL,0,'{\"score\":0,\"level\":\"bad\",\"groups\":[{\"name\":\"SEO c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n\",\"checks\":[{\"key\":\"focus_keyword\",\"label\":\"T\\u1eeb kh\\u00f3a ch\\u00ednh (Focus Keyword)\",\"status\":\"fail\",\"message\":\"Vui l\\u00f2ng nh\\u1eadp t\\u1eeb kh\\u00f3a ch\\u00ednh \\u0111\\u1ec3 k\\u00edch ho\\u1ea1t ph\\u00e2n t\\u00edch.\"},{\"key\":\"meta_title_length\",\"label\":\"\\u0110\\u1ed9 d\\u00e0i Meta Title\",\"status\":\"fail\",\"message\":\"Ch\\u01b0a c\\u1ea5u h\\u00ecnh Meta Title.\"},{\"key\":\"meta_desc_length\",\"label\":\"\\u0110\\u1ed9 d\\u00e0i Meta Description\",\"status\":\"fail\",\"message\":\"Ch\\u01b0a c\\u1ea5u h\\u00ecnh Meta Description.\"}]},{\"name\":\"N\\u1ed9i dung\",\"checks\":[{\"key\":\"content_length\",\"label\":\"\\u0110\\u1ed9 d\\u00e0i b\\u00e0i vi\\u1ebft\",\"status\":\"fail\",\"message\":\"Vui l\\u00f2ng b\\u1ed5 sung n\\u1ed9i dung b\\u00e0i vi\\u1ebft.\"}]},{\"name\":\"H\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh\",\"checks\":[{\"key\":\"image_alt_check\",\"label\":\"T\\u1ed1i \\u01b0u h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh & Alt\",\"status\":\"fail\",\"message\":\"Kh\\u00f4ng t\\u00ecm th\\u1ea5y \\u1ea3nh \\u0111\\u1ea1i di\\u1ec7n v\\u00e0 Alt tags.\"}]},{\"name\":\"Li\\u00ean k\\u1ebft\",\"checks\":[{\"key\":\"internal_link\",\"label\":\"Li\\u00ean k\\u1ebft n\\u1ed9i b\\u1ed9 (Inter